{
  "format_version": 1,
  "package_id": "unilateral-chsh",
  "formal_scope": "Lean 4.19.0 with Mathlib proves, for every positive semidefinite trace-one complex 4×4 matrix, every invertible complex 2×2 filter on either party and every quadruple of traceless Hermitian involutive qubit observables: the exact one-sided suprema, the least-eigenvalue formula with an attaining invertible filter when α > 1, the violation and hidden-activation criteria, invertible attainment of every violating supremum, the pure-marginal value and the finite-candidate theorem; a whole-project audit covers all 1,060 declarations of the 32 modules. The secular-root evaluation of the boundary radius, the polynomial activation tests, the rank-two formula, the threshold regimes, the quasi-distillable and axial families and the success-probability trade-offs are conventional.",
